<Layout title="Business & Payments — Nexus Wave Technologies" description="Business identity, products, pricing, payment and refund information for Nexus Wave Technologies.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">Business & payments</p><h1>Nexus Wave Technologies</h1><p class="lead">Independent technology business based in India, offering Nexus Plus, Geeta Nexus and selected digital tools and premium services.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Before purchase</p><h2>Product, price and billing terms are shown clearly.</h2><p class="muted">Customers should be able to understand what they are buying, the applicable price and billing period, and the relevant refund terms before confirming payment.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-2"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Business details</p><h2>Who operates the service?</h2><dl class="details"><dt>Business / brand</dt><dd>Nexus Wave Technologies</dd><dt>Founder</dt><dd>Kuldeep Kumar Yadav</dd><dt>Country</dt><dd>India</dd><dt>Website</dt><dd>nexusweb.co.in</dd><dt>Support email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></dd></dl></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">What is offered</p><h2>Products and services</h2><ul class="feature-list"><li><strong>Nexus Plus:</strong> AI, audio, media, documents and accessibility-focused utilities.</li><li><strong>Geeta Nexus:</strong> spiritual learning centred on the Bhagavad Gita.</li><li><strong>Digital tools:</strong> designated utilities made available on the website.</li><li><strong>Premium access:</strong> selected advanced capabilities may be sold as subscriptions or usage-based AI credits.</li></ul></article></div></section>

  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-3"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Free</p><h3>Basic access</h3><p class="muted">Public information, designated free tools and spiritual reading can be used without purchasing premium access.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Subscription</p><h3>Premium plans</h3><p class="muted">Where offered, a subscription unlocks the specific premium capabilities listed with the plan. The exact plan duration and price are shown before confirmation.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Usage based</p><h3>AI credits</h3><p class="muted">Some metered AI features may use credits. The credit quantity, supported feature and purchase price are shown before payment.</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container card"><p class="eyebrow">Payment flow</p><h2>How payment works</h2><p class="muted">When a paid feature is available, the customer first reviews the selected product or plan, amount, currency, billing period where applicable, and relevant terms. Payment is then handled through the configured payment gateway. Nexus Wave Technologies does not ask customers to email passwords, OTPs or complete card credentials.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/apps">Review products</a><a class="button" href="/legal/refund">Refund Policy</a><a class="button" href="/legal/terms">Terms & Conditions</a><a class="button" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-2"><article class="card"><h2>Refunds and failed payments</h2><p class="muted">Refund requests are handled according to the published Refund Policy, the transaction status, the service provided and applicable law. Failed or duplicate charges should be reported promptly with the transaction details.</p><a href="/legal/refund">Read Refund Policy</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Customer support</h2><p class="muted">For product, billing or payment questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a>. Please do not send passwords, OTPs or full payment-card details by email.</p><a href="/contact">Contact support</a></article></div></section>
</Layout>